              type: "text",
              text: "\u201EHamamas\u201C gali nusakyti konkre\u010Di\u0105 pirties aplink\u0105 ar ritualo format\u0105. SPA VILNIUS hamamo apra\u0161yme minimi garai ir marmuro aplinka, ta\u010Diau konkretaus pasi\u016Blymo sud\u0117t\u012F reikia vertinti pagal jo meniu \u012Fra\u0161\u0105."
